	val[]: "In this scenario, you must creatively find a way to make it to all the waypoints and into the final parking spot."

#### intro text

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book2_threading_needle_cutscene2"
	val[]: "Some of them may be impossible to reach with the trailer connected..."


#@}


