#+ Book 3 Scenario urf
#@{

#### urf common
	key[]: "aca_scenario_book3_urf_title"
	val[]: "Backing Sandbox"

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book3_urf_desc"
	val[]: "In this scenario, you'll be put into a empty parking lot to practise reversing with B-doubles."

#### urf goal

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_urf_start"
	val[]: "Getting Started"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_urf_move"
	val[]: "Experimenting"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_urf_stop"
	val[]: "Finishing Up"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_urf_end"
	val[]: "Ending the Scenario"

	#### urf msg - intro text

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_urf_cutscene1"
	val[]: "Reversing with B-doubles takes a lot more attention than with a single trailer. You need to plan ahead for where you want the rear trailer to go, while still keeping a handle on the lead trailer and cab. <br><br>Think of it like you are steering the rear trailer with the lead trailer. So whichever way you point the lead will change the trajectory of the rear."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_urf_cutscene2"
	val[]: "In this case, we want to turn the rear trailer to the driver's side. <br><br>To do this, we steered the lead to the passenger's side."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_urf_cutscene3"
	val[]: "This is where most people make their first mistake. Once the rear trailer starts turning, you must straighten your tractor with the lead..."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_urf_cutscene4"
	val[]: "...or you will end up jack-knifed like this."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_urf_cutscene5"
	val[]: "Jack-knifing occurs when the angle between any two vehicles in the combination becomes around 90-degrees. Once this happens, there is no saving it - you must pull forward and make another attempt. <br><br> As with reversing one trailer, the goal should always ensure all the wheels on the trailers are moving. One wheels come to a stop, and the trailer is turning in place, it's done."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_urf_cutscene6"
	val[]: "You can pull forward to where you were last correct, or rather, a position where you can continue working in reverse without getting into the same error again, or simply pull forward until you are straight."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_urf_cutscene7"
	val[]: "Again, once the rear trailer is turning, get the tractor in front of the lead and let the rear trailer turn on its own for a moment."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_urf_cutscene8"
	val[]: "Now that the rear trailer is turning nicely, it is time to get the lead following it. You can adjust the angle between the lead and the rear to control the turn and make it sharper or wider."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_urf_cutscene9"
	val[]: "The final part of the manoeuvre is straightening everything out. Get the lead in front of the rear."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_urf_cutscene10"
	val[]: "It's a good idea to keep in mind the time it takes to move the lead, and that you'll also have to get the tractor in line as well."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_urf_cutscene11"
	val[]: "Feel free to spend as much time here as you want, experiment with different manoeuvres until you think you have a rough idea of how to handle the trailers in reverse."

#### urf Driving Instructions

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_urf_start"
	val[]: "Prepárate para saír."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_urf_move"
	val[]: "Use this parking lot to get a feel for handling the trailers in reverse. <br><br>@@aca_goal_tip@@ New to backing trailers in general? Consider playing Truck Driving Basics."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_urf_stop"
	val[]: "Take as long as you want to practise. <br><br>When you are satisfied, you can stop and secure the truck to end the scenario."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_urf_end"
	val[]: "Turn off the engine to end the scenario."
#@}


#+ Book 3 Scenario sup
#@{

#### sup common
	key[]: "aca_scenario_book3_sup_title"
	val[]: "Parking in a Narrow Space"

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book3_sup_desc"
	val[]: "In this scenario, you're tasked with parking your B-double combination in a narrow space."

#### sup goal

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_sup_start"
	val[]: "Getting Started"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_sup_forward"
	val[]: "Setting Off"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_sup_check1"
	val[]: "Continue Driving"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_sup_stop"
	val[]: "Stopping"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_sup_end"
	val[]: "Securing the Vehicle"

#### sup msg - intro text

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_sup_cutscene1"
	val[]: "Driving with B-doubles can seem intimidating, but there's not much more to it than driving with a single trailer - you just have to consider the path of the rear trailer as well!"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_sup_cutscene2"
	val[]: "In front of you is a narrow parking spot. You won't have enough space to get perfectly straight before entering, so you will need to carefully consider how you will make it in with both trailers."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_sup_cutscene3"
	val[]: "Turn immediately towards the far side of the parking spot, and drive well past where you would normally turn in."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_sup_cutscene4"
	val[]: "Now that your rear trailer is on track, you can head towards the spot; you may need to go towards the far side once again to help bring your first trailer around."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_sup_cutscene5"
	val[]: "Continue into the spot, and both trailers will follow you in and straighten up as you go."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_sup_cutscene6"
	val[]: "Park in the designated area and secure the truck."

#### sup Driving Instructions

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_sup_start"
	val[]: "Prepárate para saír."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_sup_forward"
	val[]: "Proceed forward and and into the narrow space."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_sup_check1"
	val[]: "Sigue conducindo."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_sup_stop"
	val[]: "Detente na área designada."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_sup_end"
	val[]: "Inmobiliza o camión e apaga o motor."
#@}


